    Bug 1965746 - Reconcile folders with the database at start-up. r=mkmelin
    Fetches the list of existing folders from the profile files, and updates the database to match.
    I've not attempted to use the unhashed names of folders or their flags from the folder cache,
    that will happen in a later patch.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D248738

